Final answer: ### 1. Task outcome (short version):
Title/abstract screening completed for chunk of 100 studies (indices 101-200).
Results: 67 studies INCLUDED, 33 studies EXCLUDED.
Key exclusion reasons: volunteer studies (6), non-RCT designs (10), irrelevant topics (7), letters/commentaries (5), ICU
studies (1), word-presentation-only studies (2), postoperative analgesia studies (2).

