### 3. Additional context (if relevant):
Screening was conducted according to the review protocol for 'Anaesthetic interventions for prevention of awareness 
during surgery'.

Selection criteria applied:
- INCLUDED: RCTs of anaesthetic drug regimens (induction/maintenance) OR anaesthetic depth monitors (BIS, M-Entropy, 
Narcotrend, cerebral function monitor, cerebral state monitor, patient state index, lower oesophageal contractility 
monitor, AEP/AAI indices)
- EXCLUDED: Volunteer studies, studies prior to skin incision, ICU studies, studies randomizing only word presentations 
for memory tests

Key exclusion categories:
1. Volunteer studies (6): Studies 117, 118, 139, 171, 172, 179
2. Non-RCT designs (10): Studies 102, 106, 108, 109, 111, 157, 189, 190, 193, 197
3. Irrelevant topics (7): Studies 115, 123, 126, 132, 137, 138, 177
4. Letters/commentaries (5): Studies 141, 178, 187, 191, 196
5. ICU studies (1): Study 122
6. Word-presentation-only studies (2): Studies 105, 169
7. Review articles (1): Study 147
8. No anaesthetic intervention randomization (1): Study 113

All decisions were made with high confidence based on careful reading of titles and abstracts against the selection 
criteria.

